00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:58,500
It's Such a Beautiful Day is a animation, comedy
film directed by Don Hertzfeldt.

2
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Bill struggles to put together his shattered psyche.

3
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:43,500
Narrator (voice), played by Don Hertzfeldt.

4
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Doctor (voice), played by Sara Cushman.

5
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:28,500
It's Such a Beautiful Day is a 2012 American experimental animated drama film written,
directed, animated, photographed, produced, and narrated by Don Hertzfeldt.

6
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
It follows a stick figure who struggles with memory loss, surreal
visions, and other symptoms of an unknown neurological problem.

7
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:13,500
The film employs surreal humour and philosophical musings.

8
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
It mostly consists of stick figures with stylized real-life footage sometimes appearing
in split-screen windows that are photographed through multiple exposures.

9
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:58,500
The film is divided into three chapters, all of which were originally released in theaters as animated short films:
Everything Will Be OK (2006), I Am So Proud of You (2008), and It's Such a Beautiful Day (2011).

10
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:51,000
The three short films collectively received over 90 film festival awards upon their original
releases, including the Sundance Film Festival's Grand Prize for Everything Will Be OK.

11
00:42:37,500 --> 00:42:43,500
In 2012, the three chapters were combined and released as a new feature film.

12
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
It's Such a Beautiful Day received widespread critical acclaim, with its experimental
storytelling and surrealist elements being singled out for praise.

13
00:50:22,500 --> 00:50:28,500
Many listed it as one of the best films of 2012, and it has since come to be
widely regarded as one of the greatest animated films of all time.

14
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:21,000
The film explores themes of nightmare, immortality,
narration, dark comedy, surrealism.

15
00:58:07,500 --> 00:58:13,500
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
